Production has1177 active and4 incomplete Portal records and no removed Portal records, so the withdrawn Portal scenario uses the isolated fixture explicitly. Real production listing298 remains removed through deployed analysis; its historical data was not rewritten. No synthetic records, credentials or test users were inserted into production. The new live listing remained absent from production after the read-only smoke test.

