Regression fixes: core/normalization/publication_identity.py, domain/radar/detector.py, scripts/create_release_zip.py. Tests: tests/unit/test_portal_acquisition.py, test_listing_url_portal.py, test_listing_url_lookup_endpoint.py, test_create_release_zip.py, test_radar_detector.py, and tests/frontend/remediation.test.cjs. Acceptance reports, architecture notes and ledger are updated. The complete deployed31-file overlay manifest includes earlier approved remediation, report, identity and additive-migration changes. Original mixed work and pre-existing spatial/scraper work remain preserved.

